<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税提案加大了印度达成贸易协议的风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-tariff-proposal-raises-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal</link><description>美国周三宣布的关税税率给印度带来了压力，要求其同意贸易协议，否则将面临更高的征税，这使得出口商和投资者对贸易前景不太清楚。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-tariff-proposal-raises-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal'&gt;美国关税提案加大了印度达成贸易协议的风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Tariff Plan Raises Stakes for India to Clinch Trade Deal&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-tariff-proposal-raises-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:03:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks, Nasdaq Futures Climb as AI Trade Rebounds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>DHL 的 Venter：供应链弹性是增长的关键</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/dhl-s-venter-supply-chain-resilience-is-key-to-growth-video</link><description>DHL 供应链首席执行官 Hendrik Venter 表示，随着关税和地缘政治干扰使全球供应链变得更加复杂，弹性正在成为一种战略优势。他表示，DHL 第三季度同比增长 12%，其中 40% 以上来自首次外包。他与保罗·艾伦就“哈斯琳达·阿明的见解”进行了交谈。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/dhl-s-venter-supply-chain-resilience-is-key-to-growth-video'&gt;DHL 的 Venter：供应链弹性是增长的关键&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：DHL's Venter: Supply Chain Resilience Is Key to Growth&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/dhl-s-venter-supply-chain-resilience-is-key-to-growth-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:15:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>加拿大向阿联酋投资者推介基础设施计划</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/canada-pitches-infrastructure-plan-to-uae-investors-video</link><description>加拿大财政部长弗朗索瓦·菲利普·商鹏飞在迪拜对彭博电视台表示，加拿大正在从强势地位进入一个不断变化的全球秩序。他敦促中东投资者将长期资本投入该国的基础设施计划。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/canada-pitches-infrastructure-plan-to-uae-investors-video'&gt;加拿大向阿联酋投资者推介基础设施计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Canada Pitches Infrastructure Plan to UAE Investors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/canada-pitches-infrastructure-plan-to-uae-investors-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:16:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>